    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game will surely appeal to those who still remember or love the good old 8-bit games from the 80s</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110310/extras/76f5cdddc27a070dda7db9dcc8e1669b.avif?t=1726732378\" data-has-big width=800 height=548 /></span><br><br>A leisurely and exciting passage of 56 levels with endless attempts will allow you to relax and have fun.<br><br>Collect all the bolts so that your flying saucer can launch and send you to the next level.<br><br>Move items carefully to avoid getting blocked. Otherwise you will have to start the level from the beginning.<br><br>Find batteries to charge your weapon and get rid of obstacles or enemies on your way.<br>Try to choose a direct collision with alien creatures, it is deadly =(<br><br>Use portals to access closed places and keys to open doors.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game will surely appeal to those who still remember or love the good old 8-bit games from the 80s</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110310/extras/76f5cdddc27a070dda7db9dcc8e1669b.avif?t=1726732378\" data-has-big width=800 height=548 /></span><br><br>A leisurely and exciting passage of 56 levels with endless attempts will allow you to relax and have fun.<br><br>Collect all the bolts so that your flying saucer can launch and send you to the next level.<br><br>Move items carefully to avoid getting blocked. Otherwise you will have to start the level from the beginning.<br><br>Find batteries to charge your weapon and get rid of obstacles or enemies on your way.<br>Try to choose a direct collision with alien creatures, it is deadly =(<br><br>Use portals to access closed places and keys to open doors.",
    "short_description": "Mr.Robbo is a 2D logic game with action elements in the style of the 80s. Collect all the bots, clear the way to your flying saucer and try not to die from enemies, guns or magnets. 56 exciting levels await you. Good luck =)",
